      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ステラリトラさん、いつになく真剣だったけど……。\n僕に見せたいものって一体なんなんだろう……？",
      "jp_sha256": "55236ee0a20b085a2c01ff438f6e144c4a0ee4fe0f5b00c35ffbfc93f93760d5",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "스텔라리트라 씨, 평소보다 훨씬 진지했는데…….\n내게 보여 주고 싶다는 건 대체 뭘까……?",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "pro-b009-20261106-99345c75ed114c6d",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "9d4353c51e54dc2d2e91b52c1d37c85ec9e564b374593a1b6a5956450bdbe70c:000002_7274794690451095856:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ステラリトラさん、いつになく真剣だったけど……。\n僕に見せたいものって一体なんなんだろう……？"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
